t Times. <year>2007</year> Sep 11 [cited 2007 Oct 31]. Available from <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.straitstimes.com/latest+news/asia/stistory_156965.html">http://www.straitstimes.com/latest+news/asia/stistory_156965.html</ext-link></citation></ref><ref id="R30"><label>30. </label><citation citation-type="book"><string-name><surname>Luca Burci</surname> <given-names>G</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Vignes</surname> <given-names>C-H</given-names></string-name> World Health Organization. The Hague: Kluwer Law International; <year>2004</year></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>